  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building Anticipatory Action in the Asia Pacific</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This DRR investment seeks to test, build and expand new and existing anticipatory action initiatives in the Asia Pacific.  The investment will utilise the expertise of the World Food Program, the UN Office for the Coordination of Humanitarian Affairs and the Australian Humanitarian Partnership&apos;s Disaster READY program to provide mechanisms to respond to humanitarian crisis in an anticipatory way and generate evidence in AHP pilots for what works in the Pacific and Timor Leste context.</narrative>
  </description>
